{"id":"a-inf-2604","category":"info","cover":"","region":"global","publishedAt":"2025-05-25","addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:56:48.376Z","tags":[],"title":{"zh":"24年9月新车灯光新赏","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"前言：祝各位看官节日快乐！祝祖国繁荣昌盛！\n\nNissan Patrol上榜理由：送给帅气的迎宾灯，犹如车辆驶过太阳的剪影，下方的弯曲的线条巧妙地勾勒出高低起伏的路面，暗示着车辆强","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"前言：祝各位看官节日快乐！祝祖国繁荣昌盛！\n\nNissan Patrol上榜理由：送给帅气的迎宾灯，犹如车辆驶过太阳的剪影，下方的弯曲的线条巧妙地勾勒出高低起伏的路面，暗示着车辆强大的越野性能。\n\nAudi Q5上榜理由：不愧是灯厂，前后大灯卷腻了，现在开始卷高位刹车灯了，不服不行。不点亮状态下（图1）跟普通高位刹车灯没区别；一踩刹车，后挡风玻璃上就投射出一排小方块（图2），实际发光位置如图3所示，藏在与视线平行的表面。不知道后方跟车司机的视野能否看到此发光面？\n\n其他车灯赏析AION RT\n\nAston Martin Vanquish\n\nBuick OMPV Concept\n\nCupra Terramar\n\nDS SM Tribute Concept\n\nHennessey Venom 800 F-150\n\nKia EV3\n\nKia EV6 [UK]\n\nLotus Theory 1 Concept\n\nRenault Estafette\n\nToyota Hilux Hybrid 48V好久没有看过大灯碗了~\n\nVolkswagen Taos\n\nVolvo XC90\n\n五菱缤果PLUS\n\n五菱 概念车\n\n——本月分享到此结束，谢谢观赏——","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/zaoxing/2604.html","author":""},"content":[{"t":"text","v":"前言：祝各位看官节日快乐！祝祖国繁荣昌盛！"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/bfpNckwxSiaOlTyG148O1TjiaT7GicicPE14nL0HLclW3E7pY8vaV22viaXA91RNS9nv4XjuWv4IcG9r2lHObfy3zmQ/640?wx_fmt=gif"},{"t":"text","v":"Nissan Patrol上榜理由：送给帅气的迎宾灯，犹如车辆驶过太阳的剪影，下方的弯曲的线条巧妙地勾勒出高低起伏的路面，暗示着车辆强大的越野性能。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaOoYiciavAWQhPeT2y5z17PKx1ibJlXHFfvWJ2AV6p8j8pVCVwbKGGJdnWvnmg7CMSPCG9IuTPRaIhHg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaOoYiciavAWQhPeT2y5z17PKx2RTt6sh9EmTDAq4Y5eCWDw2ZmBD5BIVoJOibMh0iaT5n5oWYcpJM2I6Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaOoYiciavAWQhPeT2y5z17PKxurIXxIEibrtaOiaQE2szicSBklaXMfhSUgSk77qhkqJ5DttjA0Eib8JMJw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaOoYiciavAWQhPeT2y5z17PKxsvPwqd6mmalPj4H0BvZtMx1icQd11H0pb